    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     57,
     1
    ],
    "text": "First released in Issue 1. Derived from Issue 1 of the SVID.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00082",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     59
    ],
    "text": "[A119][/A119]Issue 5",
    "placeholders": {
     "A119": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_649_12\" id=\"tag_17_649_12\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00083",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [EBUSY] error is added to the optional part of the ERRORS section.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00084",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     63
    ],
    "text": "[A120][/A120]Issue 6",
    "placeholders": {
     "A120": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_649_13\" id=\"tag_17_649_13\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00085",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The following new requirements on POSIX implementations derive from alignment with the Single UNIX Specification:",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00086",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     3,
     1,
     1
    ],
    "text": "In the DESCRIPTION, the effect is specified if [I121]path[/I121] specifies a symbolic link.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I121": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00087",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     3,
     3,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [ELOOP] mandatory error condition is added.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00088",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     3,
     5,
     1
    ],
    "text": "A second [ENAMETOOLONG] is added as an optional error condition.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00089",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     3,
     7,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [ETXTBSY] optional error condition is added.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00090",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The following changes were made to align with the IEEE&nbsp;P1003.1a draft standard:",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00091",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     7,
     1,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [ELOOP] optional error condition is added.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00092",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     65,
     9
    ],
    "text": "The normative text is updated to avoid use of the term &quot;must&quot; for application requirements.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00093",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     67
    ],
    "text": "[A122][/A122]Issue 7",
    "placeholders": {
