    "id": "p_00094",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Austin Group Interpretation 1003.1-2001 #143 is applied.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00095",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     3
    ],
    "text": "Austin Group Interpretation 1003.1-2001 #181 is applied, updating the requirements for operations when the S_ISVTX bit is\nset.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00096",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     5
    ],
    "text": "Text arising from the LSB Conflicts TR is added to the RATIONALE about the use of [EPERM] and [EISDIR].",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00097",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     7
    ],
    "text": "The [I123]unlinkat[/I123]() function is added from The Open Group Technical Standard, 2006, Extended API Set Part 2.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I123": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00098",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     9
    ],
    "text": "Changes are made related to support for finegrained timestamps.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00099",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     11
    ],
    "text": "Changes are made to allow a directory to be opened for searching.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00100",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     13
    ],
    "text": "The [ENOTDIR] error condition is clarified to cover the condition where the last component of a pathname exists but is not a\ndirectory or a symbolic link to a directory.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00101",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     15
    ],
    "text": "POSIX.1-2008, Technical Corrigendum 1, XSH/TC1-2008/0693 [461], XSH/TC1-2008/0694 [324], XSH/TC1-2008/0695 [278], and\nXSH/TC1-2008/0696 [278] are applied.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00102",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     69,
     17
    ],
    "text": "POSIX.1-2008, Technical Corrigendum 2, XSH/TC2-2008/0378 [873], XSH/TC2-2008/0379 [591], XSH/TC2-2008/0380 [817], and\nXSH/TC2-2008/0381 [817] are applied.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
